$ 1-2: automatic envelopes. An ACT record in MAXIMA resets the action to the code defaults,
$      so every factor is repeated here from the parameters (same values as the SOFiLOAD ACT records).
$      LL patterns instead of full decks, wind one complete case at a time, temperature, EHF (ULS only).
$      Results from 4101 up (BASE + 01..99), clear of the eigen modes 2001-2010 / 2101-2110.
