$ ====================================================================================================
$ roof - group 35 - UB 254x146x43 - LTB curve B (UK NA Table NA.1, h/b 1.76), Table B.2 factors
$ ====================================================================================================
IF #L35>0
CTRL OPT EN SCL AUTO CURV B MTHD 2 BETA 0.75 LLT0 0.4 TAB NO LTB AUTO SWY NO SWZ NO LCST 9100
$ v10 reduced list (see 26016_v9_load_review): 145-148 contain 102 (+EHF), 119-126 contain 103-106/111-118/127-130
$   for every gravity-governed effect, 107-110 govern every uplift/reversal effect; 135 affects the stairs only
LC (107 110 1)       $ 1.0G + 1.5W uplift: reversal (bottom-flange compression)
LC (119 126 1)       $ Q lead + 0.75W down, W lead + 1.05Q down
LC (145 148 1)       $ 1.35G + 1.5Q + EHF (contains 102)
$ no 151-154: the deck LL patterns do not load the roof beams
$ ---------- roof radial beams (18) ----------
$ roof radial 0 deg: SLN 275 + 286 + 287, r 12.00 -> 0.66, L 11.34 m, ends: column 377/378 / kingpost plates, restraint stations: r 3.0 at 9.00 m (ring beams only), r 8.5 at 3.50 m (ring beams only)
$   spans between the ring crossings: 3.50 / 5.50 / 2.34 m, longest 5.50 m: SKY 0.485 on the MEMB record if Ncr,y is to be taken on that span (see header)
IF #JOIN>0
IF #AUTO>0
  CVA CB 0 CY AUTO CZ AUTO DX AUTO DY AUTO DZ AUTO
  CVE CB 0 CY AUTO CZ AUTO DX AUTO DY AUTO DZ AUTO
ELSE
  CVA CB 0 CY FIX CZ FIX DX FIX DY 0 DZ 0            $ fork support
  CVE CB 0 CY FIX CZ FIX DX FIX DY 0 DZ 0
ENDIF
CVL REF STRT S 9.000 CY FIX DX #DXR EZ #EZR          $ r 3.0: ring beams only
CVL REF STRT S 3.500 CY FIX DX #DXR EZ #EZR          $ r 8.5: ring beams only
IF #DECKR>0
  CVL HDIV #NPART CY FIX EZ TOP                       $ top-flange lateral restraint by the deck
ENDIF
MEMB SLN 275 TYPE LTB ID 275
     CONT 286
     CONT 287
ELSE
