$ ====================================================================================================
$ columns and rakers - SHS 150x150x10 (section 1), 103 lines - flexural buckling about y and z, interaction with
$ the Annex B factors (closed section: chi_LT = 1, see header). Each line alone, fork ends, Lcr = L (non-sway frame, see
$ header). Flexural buckling curve a (hot finished) from the AQUA SECT BCY/BCZ.
$ ====================================================================================================
IF #COL>0
IF #COLD>0
  IF #SWAY>0
  CTRL OPT EN SCL AUTO CURV C MTHD 2 BETA 0.75 LLT0 0.4 TAB NO LTB AUTO SWY YES SWZ YES LCST 9100
  ELSE
  CTRL OPT EN SCL AUTO CURV C MTHD 2 BETA 0.75 LLT0 0.4 TAB NO LTB AUTO SWY NO SWZ NO LCST 9100
  ENDIF
ELSE
  IF #SWAY>0
  CTRL OPT EN SCL AUTO CURV B MTHD 2 BETA 0.75 LLT0 0.4 TAB NO LTB AUTO SWY YES SWZ YES LCST 9100
  ELSE
  CTRL OPT EN SCL AUTO CURV B MTHD 2 BETA 0.75 LLT0 0.4 TAB NO LTB AUTO SWY NO SWZ NO LCST 9100
  ENDIF
ENDIF
$ v10 reduced list (see 26016_v9_load_review): columns/rakers are compression-governed, so 145-148 (contain 102)
$   and 119-126 (contain 103-106/111-118/127-130) cover them; uplift 107-110 only relieves compression, 135 = stairs only
LC (119 126 1)       $ Q lead + 0.75W down, W lead + 1.05Q down
LC (145 148 1)       $ 1.35G + 1.5Q + EHF (contains 102)
$ ---------- group 11: V-column raker, ground to L1 (18 lines) ----------
$ group 11 SLN 19: V-column raker, ground to L1, RHS 150x150x10, L 5.81 m, z 0.00 -> 4.05, 44 deg to the horizontal, fork ends, Lcr = L
IF #AUTO>0
  CVA CB 0 CY AUTO CZ AUTO DX AUTO DY AUTO DZ AUTO
  CVE CB 0 CY AUTO CZ AUTO DX AUTO DY AUTO DZ AUTO
ELSE
  CVA CB 0 CY FIX CZ FIX DX FIX DY 0 DZ 0            $ fork support
