$ ====================================================================================================
$ stair landing members - RHS 50x50x5 (section 6), 20 lines, group 60 - flexural buckling + interaction (chi_LT = 1), each line alone, fork ends
$ ====================================================================================================
IF #LAND>0
IF #COLD>0
  CTRL OPT EN SCL AUTO CURV C MTHD 2 BETA 0.75 LLT0 0.4 TAB NO LTB AUTO SWY NO SWZ NO LCST 9101
ELSE
  CTRL OPT EN SCL AUTO CURV B MTHD 2 BETA 0.75 LLT0 0.4 TAB NO LTB AUTO SWY NO SWZ NO LCST 9101
ENDIF
$ v10 reduced list (see 26016_v9_load_review): as the deck beams, plus 135 (stair barriers inward), no deck patterns; v13 no temperature
LC (107 110 1)       $ 1.0G + 1.5W uplift: stair flights get wind uplift (VF)
LC (119 126 1)       $ Q lead + 0.75W down, W lead + 1.05Q down
LC (135 135 1)       $ barriers inward
LC (145 148 1)       $ 1.35G + 1.5Q + EHF (contains 102)
