ELSE
  CVA CB 0 CY FIX CZ FIX DX FIX DY 0 DZ 0            $ fork support
  CVE CB 0 CY FIX CZ FIX DX FIX DY 0 DZ 0
ENDIF
MEMB SLN 19 TYPE LTB ID 19
$ group 13 SLN 37: vertical column, RHS 150x150x10, L 4.05 m, z 0.00 -> 4.05, 90 deg to the horizontal, fork ends, Lcr = L
IF #AUTO>0
  CVA CB 0 CY AUTO CZ AUTO DX AUTO DY AUTO DZ AUTO
  CVE CB 0 CY AUTO CZ AUTO DX AUTO DY AUTO DZ AUTO
ELSE
  CVA CB 0 CY FIX CZ FIX DX FIX DY 0 DZ 0            $ fork support
  CVE CB 0 CY FIX CZ FIX DX FIX DY 0 DZ 0
ENDIF
MEMB SLN 37 TYPE LTB ID 37
$ group 60 SLN 79: stair stringer, post or landing beam, RHS 250x150x16, L 2.96 m, z 6.28 -> 8.05, 37 deg to the horizontal, fork ends, Lcr = L
IF #AUTO>0
  CVA CB 0 CY AUTO CZ AUTO DX AUTO DY AUTO DZ AUTO
